{
  "id": "one-column-banded-serif",
  "name": "jacky_leo_wu",
  "description": "Serif one column with centred headings on a grey band, a two-column contact block and right-aligned dates. Reads summary, skills, experience, education.",
  "disabled": false,
  "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>{{name}} - Resume</title>\n<style>\n@page{margin:0.5in 0.55in}\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{background:#ffffff}\nbody{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.36;color:#15181c}\n\n/* The masthead: name, the role beneath it, then contact in two columns. */\n.header{margin-bottom:12px}\n.name{font-size:23pt;font-weight:700;line-height:1.08}\n.headline{font-size:13pt;color:#23272c;margin-top:1px;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Two columns, as the design draws it. Each field is its own box, which is\n   also what lets the separator pass measure the pair and keep the email from\n   welding onto the LinkedIn URL beside it. */\n/* max-content, not 1fr: the columns hug their own text. With equal halves the\n   left field ended mid-page and the injected separator below trailed after it\n   with an inch of white before the right field, which reads as a dangling mark\n   rather than as a separator between two fields. */\n.contact{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content max-content;gap:3px 10px;font-size:9.8pt}\n.contact-item{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;min-width:0}\n.contact-icon{flex:0 0 auto;line-height:1;position:relative;top:1px}\n.contact-text{min-width:0;word-break:break-word}\n/*\n * THE INJECTED MIDDLE DOT STAYS, and the only thing changed here is where it\n * does not belong.\n *\n * The render-time stylesheet puts \" . \" after every contact field but the last.\n * Switching it off on this template looked right on one profile - a short\n * location left a real space between the grid cells in the PDF's text stream -\n * and was wrong on the next: with \"The Colony, TX\" in the first cell the two\n * cells printed \"TXjonalai0897@gmail.com\", one token, which is the exact defect\n * the dot was added for. The separator PASS cannot rescue it either: it skips\n * any box whose display is flex, and each field here is a flex row with its\n * icon. So the dot is the only thing between these two cells, and it stays.\n *\n * What is switched off is the dot that ENDS a grid row. This block is two\n * columns, so every second field is followed by a line break rather than by\n * another field, and the dot there separates nothing and prints as a dangling\n * mark at the end of the line.\n */\n.contact>*:nth-child(2n)::after{content:none}\n\n.section{margin-bottom:11px}\n/* The banded heading: centred, bold, full width - and NO letter-spacing.\n   Tracking a heading makes Chrome place it glyph by glyph, and a heading that\n   leaves the PDF as \"E D U C AT I O N\" matches nothing a parser looks for. */\n.section-title{background:#ececec;text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5pt;\n  letter-spacing:0;padding:3px 6px;margin-bottom:7px}\n/* Left, never justified: justifying positions every word separately. */\n.summary-text{text-align:left}\n\n/* One entry is a left block and a right block side by side. The right one is a\n   sibling, never a float, so the separator pass can measure the pair. */\n.entry{margin-bottom:9px}\n.entry:last-child{margin-bottom:0}\n.entry-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:18px}\n.entry-left{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0}\n.entry-right{flex:0 0 auto;text-align:right;font-size:9.8pt}\n/* Title and employer are one line of text with a comma between them, so there\n   is no pair of adjacent boxes to read back as \"EngineerAcme\". THE COMMA IS A\n   TEXT NODE BETWEEN THE TWO SPANS, not the first character of the second one,\n   and that is the difference between \"Senior Engineer, Samsara\" and\n   \"Senior Engineer  , Samsara\": the separator pass appends a gap between two\n   adjacent inline boxes unless something printable already sits between them,\n   and a comma inside the right-hand span is not between them. */\n.job-title,.edu-degree{font-weight:700}\n.company-name,.edu-institution{font-weight:400}\n/* Nowrap, so a range is never broken across two lines and read as two\n   half-dates. */\n.job-date{white-space:nowrap}\n.entry-location{color:#2a2f35}\nul.achievements{margin:3px 0 0 15px}\nul.achievements li{margin-bottom:2px}\n\n/* Grouped: one line per heading, \"Cloud & Infrastructure: AWS, Terraform\". */\nul.skills-list{margin:0 0 0 15px}\nul.skills-list li{margin-bottom:2px}\n/* NO SECOND MARKER, and no second separator. One of the six render-time looks\n   puts a small square before the heading; here each group is a LIST ITEM, so\n   the list already draws a marker and the square prints beside it. This\n   stylesheet comes after the render-time one, so these win. */\n.skill-category-title::before{content:none}\n.skill-category-title,.skill-category-skills{display:inline;color:#15181c;margin:0;padding:0}\n.skill-category-title{font-weight:700}\n.skill-category-title::after{content:\":\"}\n.skill-category-skills{font-weight:400}\n/* Flat: two columns of bullets, which is the shape the design was drawn from. */\nul.skills-list.skills-flat{columns:2;column-gap:28px}\nul.skills-list.skills-flat li{break-inside:avoid}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body data-section-order=\"summary,skills,experience,education\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<div class=\"name\">{{name}}</div>\n{{#if title}}<div class=\"headline\">{{title}}</div>{{/if}}\n<div class=\"contact\">{{#if contact.location}}<div class=\"contact-item\"><span class=\"contact-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg></span><span class=\"contact-text\">{{contact.location}}</span></div>{{/if}}{{#if contact.email}}<div class=\"contact-item\"><span class=\"contact-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"/></svg></span><span class=\"contact-text\">{{contact.email}}</span></div>{{/if}}{{#if contact.phone}}<div class=\"contact-item\"><span class=\"contact-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13.1 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.64 4.55 2 2 0 0 1 3.62 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6.09 6.09l.97-.97a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"contact-text\">{{contact.phone}}</span></div>{{/if}}{{#if contact.linkedin}}<div class=\"contact-item\"><span class=\"contact-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"contact-text\">{{contact.linkedin}}</span></div>{{/if}}{{#if contact.github}}<div class=\"contact-item\"><span class=\"contact-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"contact-text\">{{contact.github}}</span></div>{{/if}}{{#if contact.portfolio}}<div class=\"contact-item\"><span class=\"contact-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"contact-text\">{{contact.portfolio}}</span></div>{{/if}}</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section section-summary\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Summary</div>\n<div class=\"summary-text\">{{summary}}</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section section-skills\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Skills</div>\n{{#if skillCategories.[0].category}}<ul class=\"skills-list\">{{#each skillCategories}}<li><span class=\"skill-category-title\">{{category}}</span> <span class=\"skill-category-skills\">{{join skills \", \"}}</span></li>{{/each}}</ul>{{else}}<ul class=\"skills-list skills-flat\">{{#if hardSkills.length}}{{#each hardSkills}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}{{else}}{{#each skills}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}{{/if}}</ul>{{/if}}\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section section-experience\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Professional Experience</div>\n{{#each experience}}\n<div class=\"entry\"><div style=\"break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid\">\n<div class=\"entry-head\">\n<div class=\"entry-left\"><span class=\"job-title\">{{title}}</span>{{#if company}}, <span class=\"company-name\">{{company}}</span>{{/if}}</div>\n<div class=\"entry-right\"><div class=\"job-date\">{{startDate}}{{#if endDate}} - {{endDate}}{{/if}}</div>{{#if location}}<div class=\"entry-location\">{{location}}</div>{{/if}}</div>\n</div>\n</div><ul class=\"achievements\">{{#each achievements}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>\n</div>\n{{/each}}\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section section-education\" style=\"break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Education</div>\n{{#each education}}\n<div class=\"entry\">\n<div class=\"entry-head\">\n<div class=\"entry-left\"><span class=\"edu-degree\">{{degree}}</span>{{#if institution}}, <span class=\"edu-institution\">{{institution}}</span>{{/if}}</div>\n<div class=\"entry-right\"><div class=\"job-date\">{{startDate}}{{#if endDate}} - {{endDate}}{{/if}}</div>{{#if location}}<div class=\"entry-location\">{{location}}</div>{{/if}}{{#if gpa}}<div class=\"entry-location\">GPA: {{gpa}}</div>{{/if}}</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n{{/each}}\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "cssContent": "",
  "sections": [
    "summary",
    "hardSkills",
    "experience",
    "education"
  ],
  "createdAt": "2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z"
